# Deep links for the client routes in src/main.jsx, listed one by one.
#
# Deliberately NOT a `/*` catch-all: that matched /assets/* too, so an asset
# request that missed at an edge during a deploy came back as 200 text/html
# rather than a 404 — and the /assets/* rule in _headers then marked that wrong
# answer `immutable` for a year. Edge and browser cached an HTML document under
# a .css URL, and whoever hit that node got a completely unstyled page.
#
# Exact paths rather than /industries/*: the splat form did not match on Pages
# (deep links 404'd once public/404.html removed the built-in SPA fallback that
# had been quietly answering them). Two routes, so enumerating costs nothing.
# Add a line here whenever a route is added to main.jsx.
/industries/ca-firms  /index.html  200
/industries/solar     /index.html  200
